# The site builds and runs with no environment variables. Everything below is
# optional — set a variable only when you want the feature it unlocks.

# Contact page map animation (Mapbox GL fly-to). Without it the contact
# page falls back to the Google Maps embed.
#   PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=pk.xxxxx

# TikTok advertising. Set this to the Pixel ID from TikTok Ads Manager
# (Tools > Events > Web Events) to enable conversion tracking for TikTok
# campaigns. Leave it unset and no advertising script is shipped at all.
# The pixel additionally waits for the visitor to accept the cookie banner.
# Full campaign setup: docs/tiktok-ads.md
#   PUBLIC_TIKTOK_PIXEL_ID=XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

# Populated in Phase 6 (Deploy):
#   PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=
#   RESEND_API_KEY=           # if sell-your-car form lands on email
#   AIRTABLE_API_KEY=         # if form writes to Airtable
#   AIRTABLE_BASE_ID=
